INT. HANDOFF NOTES 2026-04-27 12:05:00

NEXT SESSION PICKUP POINT:

Step 4 — ffprobe duration extraction — is designed but NOT YET IMPLEMENTED.

Implementation plan:
  1. In audioinfo.go, add func ffprobeDuration(path string) (string, error)
       exec.LookPath("ffprobe") — return "" if not found
       exec.Command("ffprobe", "-v", "quiet", "-print_format", "json",
                    "-show_streams", path)
       parse JSON: streams[0].duration (float string, seconds)
       convert to ISO 8601: PT{M}M{S}S (or PT{H}H{M}M{S}S for >1h)
  2. In ProcessAudioFile, call ffprobeDuration after the tag read block;
     set info.Duration only if a non-empty string is returned.
  3. Add unit tests in audioinfo_test.go:
       TestFFprobeDuration (skip if ffprobe not in PATH)
       Verify ProcessAudioFile sets Duration when ffprobe is available.
  4. Update codemeta.json dateModified to current date after implementation.

